    "updated_at": "2023-04-28T08:01:57Z",
    "body": "I think we could do \"an implementation-defined URL\".\r\n\r\nI wonder if @camillelamy could comment on the COOP aspects though. We wouldn't want that URL to end up in some kind of report, but I think that could only happen if the frame decided to opener popup something, which seems unlikely for user-agent-controlled content.",
